></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858601\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-0\"><div class=\"comp-divider-no-line magic-4\"><span class=\"comp-divider-line\"></span></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858602\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><span data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"text\" data-edit-label=\"&#x6807;&#x9898;\" class=\"comp-navigation-sib magic-6\">OTHER PRODUCT IMAGES</span></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858603\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-singleimg-wrap magic-4\"><img class=\"comp-singleimg-img magic-5\" data-edit-type=\"image\" data-edit-position=\"image_urls[0]\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56FE;&#x7247;\" src=\"https://sc02.alicdn.com/kf/S4fb3d55b750b41d79a1336f4a6edf5098.png\" alt=\"image\"></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858604\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-singleimg-wrap magic-4\"><img class=\"comp-singleimg-img magic-5\" data-edit-type=\"image\" data-edit-position=\"image_urls[0]\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56FE;&#x7247;\" src=\"https://sc02.alicdn.com/kf/Sb72d624c620a48858a9a4a4378608190n.png\" alt=\"image\"></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858605\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-singleimg-wrap magic-4\"><img class=\"comp-singleimg-img magic-5\" data-edit-type=\"image\" data-edit-position=\"image_urls[0]\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56FE;&#x7247;\" src=\"https://sc02.alicdn.com/kf/S3360572e55694526bdc1e4f331d00d01U.png\" alt=\"image\"></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858606\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-singleimg-wrap magic-4\"><img class=\"comp-singleimg-img magic-5\" data-edit-type=\"image\" data-edit-position=\"image_urls[0]\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56FE;&#x7247;\" src=\"https://sc02.alicdn.com/kf/S18c48ad263984d7f8a2da3b665c32805P.png\" alt=\"image\"></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"3000043813977\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-singleimg-wrap magic-4\"><img class=\"comp-singleimg-img magic-5\" data-edit-type=\"image\" data-edit-position=\"image_urls[0]\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56FE;&#x7247;\" src=\"https://sc02.alicdn.com/kf/S46db2ef231504665a6c30c81667f6bc0V.png\" alt=\"image\"></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"3000043813978\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-0\"><div class=\"comp-divider-no-line magic-4\"><span class=\"comp-divider-line\"></span></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000335858609\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-1\"><div class=\"comp-faq-title magic-2\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"title\" data-edit-label=\"&#x6807;&#x9898;\">FAQs</div><div data-edit-type=\"faqList\" data-edit-position=\"faqList\"><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[0].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">Are you a factory or a trading company?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[0].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\"><span>We are a footwear factory located in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We supply casual walking shoes and related footwear for overseas B2B buyers. Product details and order requirements are confirmed according to the current style.</span></div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[1].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">&#xA0;What is your MOQ?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[1].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\">&#xA0;For available styles, small trial orders can be discussed. We support mixed colors and mixed sizes to help buyers test the market. For customized orders, MOQ depends on logo, packaging and material requirements.</div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[2].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">Can I mix different colors and sizes in one order?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[2].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\">&#xA0;Yes. Mixed colors and mixed sizes are supported for available styles. Mixed styles can also be discussed according to stock and order quantity.</div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[3].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">Can I order samples before bulk order?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[3].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\"><span>Yes. Samples can be arranged for quality checking. The sample fee, courier cost, development time and any bulk-order policy will be confirmed for the current style before payment.</span></div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[4].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">Do you support customized packaging?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[4].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\">Yes. Standard packaging can be shoe box or plastic bag. For large orders, customized packaging such as custom shoe box, label or packing method can be discussed.</div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[5].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">&#xA0;Do you support logo or product customization?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[5].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\">Logo, color, size ratio and packaging customization can be discussed. Please send your design, target quantity and market requirements, and we will check the production solution for you.</div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[6].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">&#xA0;How long is the delivery time?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[6].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\">Delivery time depends on stock, order quantity and customization requirements. Available styles can usually be arranged faster, while customized or bulk production needs to be confirmed before order.</div></div><div class=\"comp-faq-card\"><div class=\"comp-faq-question magic-7\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[7].question\" data-edit-label=\"&#x95EE;&#x9898;\">Why choose your factory?</div><div class=\"comp-faq-answer magic-3\" data-edit-type=\"text\" data-edit-position=\"faqList[7].answer\" data-edit-label=\"&#x56DE;&#x7B54;\"><span>We provide factory support for product confirmation, sample checking, mixed size and color discussion, packing requirements and OEM/ODM cooperation. Final specifications are confirmed according to the current style and order details.</span></div></div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <div module-id=\"10000340699822\" module-title=\"detailStructured\" render=\"true\" class=\"J_module\"><div class=\"magic-0\"><div class=\"comp-divider-no-line magic-4\"><span class=\"comp-divider-line\"></span></div></div></div>\n      </div>",
